	(text "RTC (U401): real-time clock with a backup battery"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ad6dc43f-4588-505b-9324-b2cf9435b0da")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nKeeps the date and time, also while the vehicle is off: the CR2032 coin cell (BT401) powers the clock then.\nThe ESP32 reads and sets it over I2C (address 0x68). RTC_INT can signal an alarm to the ESP32 (GPIO13).\n\nPINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\n+3V3 (in): supply from the 3.3 V regulator (ESP32 + USB module)\nGND: ground\nI2C_SCL, I2C_SDA (both ways): the shared I2C bus to the ESP32 (its pull-ups R211/R212 are in the IMU module)\nRTC_INT (out): alarm/interrupt to ESP32 GPIO13, active low\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 265 24.5)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "981830d9-bebe-5cd1-bf01-d208a4c2a3e5")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 137.16 91.44)
		(end 175.26 139.7)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "939eb53a-7880-5d15-937d-d15c47f7e86c")
	)
	(text "keep together on the PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.76 92.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8adfda07-af2f-5bba-bedf-aac22f6ffd2f")
	)
	(text "C401 belongs to U401 pin 2 (VCC):\non the PCB within 2 mm of that pin,\nwith a GND via beside its GND pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d489a249-732a-52c1-b079-57027c483f00")
	)
	(text "C402 belongs to U401 pin 6 (VBAT):\nplace it next to that pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d6d604d0-7783-545e-9c81-d89abf38cc74")
	)
	(text_box "PARTS AND THEIR JOBS\nU401: DS3231M real-time clock with a built-in crystal (+/-5 ppm). Pins 1 (32KHZ) and 4 (RST) are not used (X = no connection).\nC401: 100 nF decoupling for U401 VCC (pin 2). Must sit at pin 2 on the PCB.\nC402: 100 nF decoupling for U401 VBAT (pin 6), the battery input. Place at pin 6.\nBT401: CR2032 coin-cell holder (board bottom). Not rechargeable, so there is no charging circuit. Keep it 20 mm or more away from the magnetometer U602.\nR401: 10k pull-up: INT/SQW can only pull low (open drain), R401 pulls RTC_INT back up to 3.3 V.\nPWR_FLAG: Not a part: tells KiCad's electrical check that the battery powers the RTC_VBAT net."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 156 0)
		(size 155 20.4)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29838865-0e4b-57e9-9fa1-6a421c7ee59d")
	)
